WEBVTT

00:00.650 --> 00:04.190
<i>This is the Tearmoon Empire's 
Gold Moon Ministry.</i>

00:04.580 --> 00:09.650
Um, Princess Mia, what business 
brings you here of all places?

00:10.020 --> 00:14.110
Well, a man I wish to see is here.

00:15.360 --> 00:17.580
A man you wish to see...

00:18.120 --> 00:19.390
You don't mean...

00:22.290 --> 00:27.000
<i>I see what's going on. I shall 
faithfully serve as wingwoman!</i>

00:27.450 --> 00:31.710
<i>Anne got fired up over her
perception of the situation,</i>

00:31.950 --> 00:35.670
<i>unbeknownst to Mia, who was preoccupied...</i>

00:37.270 --> 00:41.930
<i>recalling her encounter in the previous 
timeline with a young civil servant</i>

00:41.930 --> 00:46.010
<i>fighting a solitary battle to balance 
the empire's financial scales.</i>

00:48.450 --> 00:50.640
You must be Ludwig.

00:51.920 --> 00:54.610
Your reputation precedes you.

00:55.260 --> 00:57.910
Your excellent work is recognized.

00:59.000 --> 01:04.250
Do you know how much is spent 
on the royal family's meals?

01:06.340 --> 01:10.630
I-I have graciously come 
in person to praise you.

01:10.630 --> 01:12.170
To be spoken to like this—

01:14.300 --> 01:18.010
It will be a hindrance to have 
you just standing there forever.

01:19.160 --> 01:20.100
If you have spare time,

01:20.730 --> 01:25.310
use it do to do something only a princess 
can do, Your Highness Princess Mia.

01:28.470 --> 01:33.440
<i>That four-eyed nerd.
 I refuse to let that stand!</i>

01:33.440 --> 01:35.860
<i>It could hardly have gone worse.</i>

01:36.370 --> 01:38.440
Third-class Tax Officer Ludwig!

01:38.440 --> 01:43.290
Since you have so much to say about it, 
you'll be loaned out to the Crimson Moon Ministry.

01:43.290 --> 01:44.830
<i>This is bad.</i>

01:44.830 --> 01:48.270
<i>If Ludwig is sent off to the provinces, 
by the time he comes back,</i>

01:48.270 --> 01:51.380
<i>matters in the Tearmoon Empire 
will have progressed too far.</i>

01:51.380 --> 01:53.000
<i>In other words, if I don't do something...</i>

01:55.010 --> 01:58.380
<i>I'll be hurtling straight 
toward the guillotine!</i>

01:59.350 --> 02:01.600
J-Just one moment!

02:01.880 --> 02:03.720
P-Princess Mia, Your Highness!

02:04.320 --> 02:06.430
What is Princess Mia doing?

02:08.630 --> 02:10.600
Might I have a word with you?

02:12.150 --> 02:13.770
Princess Mia is so bold!

03:48.450 --> 03:53.210
<b>Episode 2: Princess Mia Displays Her Smug Face</b>

03:49.000 --> 03:53.210
I must—excuse me—there are 
matters that require my attention.

03:53.440 --> 03:55.780
I wish to chat with you.

03:56.300 --> 03:59.760
Um, I just told you I'm busy.

03:59.760 --> 04:03.050
I have something I wish to ask you.

04:03.590 --> 04:05.500
So you don't care.

04:07.520 --> 04:10.230
<i>Her level of willfulness 
exceeds what I've heard...</i>

04:11.530 --> 04:13.940
So, what do you want to ask?

04:14.380 --> 04:18.770
Let's see... Stripped down to its core,

04:19.340 --> 04:24.650
I suppose my question is: How do 
we set the empire's finances right?

04:27.860 --> 04:30.700
In that case, answer me this, 
Your Highness Princess Mia.

04:31.210 --> 04:36.420
To begin with, are you aware of how much 
is being spent on Your Highness's meals?

04:39.120 --> 04:43.010
To speak of setting the empire right 
without even that much knowledge—

04:43.010 --> 04:44.720
Well, let's see...

04:45.680 --> 04:49.770
For each meal, about one 
month's worth of your pay.

04:49.770 --> 04:53.390
Roughly one gold crescent 
moon coin, I would say.

04:55.360 --> 05:00.030
To begin with, the problem with 
 the empire's finances is, simply put,

04:59.120 --> 05:01.620
<i>Th-This is...</i>

05:00.030 --> 05:05.780
that there's more money going out than 
coming in. In order to solve that...

05:03.310 --> 05:05.780
<i>just incredibly...</i>

05:06.240 --> 05:09.690
<i>satisfying!</i>

05:11.900 --> 05:14.460
Are you listening, <i>Princess?</i>

05:14.980 --> 05:21.170
To hold such a high position and yet be utterly 
ignorant of the situation the nation is facing...

05:21.170 --> 05:23.510
Some princess you are.

05:23.510 --> 05:27.550
To begin with, the problem with 
 the empire's finances is, simply put,

05:27.550 --> 05:31.180
that there's more money 
going out than coming in.

05:31.180 --> 05:32.890
And in order to solve that...

05:33.440 --> 05:35.220
<i>That damned four-eyes!</i>

05:35.220 --> 05:38.110
<i>This humiliation! I'll record 
every word down to the letter</i>

05:38.110 --> 05:40.000
<i>and never forget this as long as I live!</i>

05:40.000 --> 05:41.610
<i>Yes. In short...</i>

05:41.610 --> 05:45.960
The empire has quite a few other 
major problems. In particular,

05:45.960 --> 05:50.020
the costs of our worsening relationships 
with neighboring nations are immeasurable.

05:50.020 --> 05:52.580
<i>her entire answer was copied.</i>

05:53.080 --> 05:54.790
That is enough.

05:57.120 --> 06:00.640
Where has Princess Mia gone?

06:09.910 --> 06:12.850
Princess Mia's romance has begun!

06:14.900 --> 06:19.400
To have so sagacious an individual in the 
royal family... I am struck with admiration.

06:20.980 --> 06:24.360
D-Did he just say sagacious?!

06:23.650 --> 06:29.240
<b>Sa</b>

06:24.110 --> 06:29.240
<b>gacious</b>

06:24.360 --> 06:29.240
That dour four-eyes is actually 
s-singing my praises?!

06:29.490 --> 06:34.450
<i>Ah, it's like... I feel like
 I was reincarnated for this day.</i>

06:35.120 --> 06:37.160
Pardon me, Your Highness Princess Mia.

06:38.880 --> 06:41.120
Given your keen understanding,

06:41.120 --> 06:46.340
I imagine you could set the country straight 
without any help from the likes of me.

06:47.130 --> 06:48.640
<i>Oh, no!</i>

06:48.640 --> 06:50.800
<i>I got too carried away!</i>

06:51.140 --> 06:54.960
Um, er, uh, that may be true, 
but well, you know...

06:54.960 --> 06:58.270
<i>It's no use. I can't think 
of a single thing to say.</i>

06:58.620 --> 07:00.480
Oh, I hadn't considered...

07:01.200 --> 07:03.530
You are indeed still quite 
young, Princess Mia.

07:04.070 --> 07:06.670
People may not listen to you.

07:06.670 --> 07:09.100
Would that be your concern?

07:11.450 --> 07:13.010
Yes, that!

07:13.010 --> 07:15.400
That is it exactly!

07:15.400 --> 07:17.660
<i>Mia jumped on that hard.</i>

07:17.660 --> 07:23.570
Besides, no matter how sagacious 
I may be, I can still be wrong.

07:23.570 --> 07:28.380
Which is why I would like to be able to 
consult you and hear your unreserved opinion.

07:28.750 --> 07:33.580
You remain humble about your intelligence
 and solicit counsel from your retainers?

07:34.120 --> 07:36.140
What an admirable attitude!

07:36.140 --> 07:41.560
<i>Ludwig's eyes had been completely clouded 
by the shock he experienced earlier.</i>

07:43.000 --> 07:44.520
In that case, Your Highness,

07:45.460 --> 07:50.910
I, Ludwig Hewitt, pledge to 
give my all in assisting you.

07:55.680 --> 08:00.450
Your Highness Princess Mia, 
this will be my last visit.

08:02.660 --> 08:04.060
Though there were rocky moments,

08:05.040 --> 08:07.030
I will fondly remember...

08:08.400 --> 08:10.210
the time spent in your service.

08:13.090 --> 08:19.100
<i>Thus it was that Mia obtained 
her greatest ally after Anne.</i>

08:24.700 --> 08:27.770
Hm, what was it that happens next?

08:31.310 --> 08:32.950
<i>Wh-What?!</i>

08:34.940 --> 08:40.240
<i>"Thus would begin my steady march 
forward being famed for sagacity."</i>

08:41.190 --> 08:43.070
<i>Wh-What's this?</i>

08:43.070 --> 08:49.330
<i>Does this mean that Ludwig's help brought 
about a major change in history?</i>

08:50.070 --> 08:52.210
Then maybe...

09:01.960 --> 09:05.180
<i>My fate at the guillotine remains unchanged.</i>

09:06.640 --> 09:10.320
<i>It's alright! I still have time!</i>

09:10.320 --> 09:14.070
<i>If I read the changed content of 
my diary and develop a strategy...</i>

09:14.650 --> 09:17.280
<i>An epidemic in the slums of the capital,</i>

09:17.280 --> 09:20.640
<i>an uprising by a minority group 
on the empire's periphery,</i>

09:20.640 --> 09:23.460
<i>and, in addition, a smattering 
of international issues...</i>

09:26.240 --> 09:28.510
<i>How should I know what 
to do about any of this?!</i>

09:28.510 --> 09:29.590
<i>Oh, right!</i>

09:30.730 --> 09:32.070
Anne.

09:32.070 --> 09:37.410
The rotten four-e—I mean, I'll 
be heading out to see Ludwig.

09:37.410 --> 09:39.600
Ah, I remember him.

09:39.600 --> 09:42.930
In that case, we ought to change your dress.

09:42.930 --> 09:47.350
Really? What I have on now strikes 
me as adequate for the occasion.

09:47.350 --> 09:52.260
This won't do! When it comes to these matters,
 it's important to make an impression!

09:55.610 --> 09:58.200
You look fantastic, Princess Mia.

09:58.200 --> 09:59.460
You think so?

09:59.460 --> 10:02.120
Yes. Now for the finishing touch.

10:04.760 --> 10:08.040
Oh? I believe this is...

10:08.440 --> 10:14.000
The gift that one wealthy merchant 
presented to you last year.

10:14.550 --> 10:16.970
Right. Of course.

10:17.610 --> 10:22.300
So, after you go see him 
then where will you go?

10:22.720 --> 10:25.340
Oh, well...

10:27.830 --> 10:30.710
W-Why are we in the New Moon District?

10:30.710 --> 10:33.780
Princess Mia, Your Highness, 
let's turn back.

10:33.780 --> 10:38.020
Even the general populace does not come here.

10:38.020 --> 10:39.460
Anything might happen.

10:39.460 --> 10:42.240
No. This is a necessary trip.

10:42.790 --> 10:46.700
I need to have you see it 
in person and advise me.

10:49.610 --> 10:50.670
I must say...

10:51.090 --> 10:53.000
It smells foul here.

10:53.260 --> 10:55.620
It doesn't seem that bad to me.

10:55.620 --> 10:56.460
What?

10:57.590 --> 11:00.790
<i>Compared to my cell, 
it's practically pleasant.</i>

11:02.650 --> 11:07.850
For the people here, arranging for 
a bath must be no simple task.

11:08.720 --> 11:14.770
Anyone who went several days without 
cleaning their body would start to smell.

11:15.290 --> 11:18.190
Come. We mustn't be 
distracted by such things.

11:18.190 --> 11:21.740
Your Highness, where are we headed exactly?

11:23.040 --> 11:25.060
A fine question...

11:26.280 --> 11:27.080
Look over there.

11:30.720 --> 11:33.570
Can you hear me? Are you alright?

11:33.570 --> 11:35.500
Your Highness, what are you doing?

11:39.800 --> 11:42.550
His hunger must be so severe 
that he can no longer move.

11:42.550 --> 11:45.180
It's a common occurrence in this area.

11:45.900 --> 11:46.850
I see.

11:47.590 --> 11:51.140
To go hungry would indeed be hard to bear.

11:51.900 --> 11:55.280
Anne, share the snacks
 you're carrying with him.

11:55.280 --> 11:56.360
Oh, of course.

11:57.680 --> 12:02.070
In such a malnourished state, 
he could fall ill at any time.

12:03.410 --> 12:07.760
<i>On account of an epidemic that 
sweeps through the capital,</i>

12:07.760 --> 12:10.850
<i>ten percent of the capital's 
populace lose their lives,</i>

12:10.850 --> 12:15.290
<i>wreaking havoc on the empire's finances, 
which Ludwig had nearly fixed.</i>

12:15.790 --> 12:18.750
<i>I cannot afford to let that happen.</i>

12:19.590 --> 12:20.420
<i>But...</i>

12:21.610 --> 12:22.680
Ludwig.

12:23.530 --> 12:28.470
What do we do to prevent a disease 
outbreak here in the future?

12:29.780 --> 12:31.410
Prevent a disease outbreak?!

12:32.140 --> 12:37.520
Princess Mia, it seems best to find 
somewhere for this child to rest.

12:37.520 --> 12:40.710
There appears to be a church on 
the other end of this street.

12:40.710 --> 12:43.150
Very well. Let us head there.

12:43.890 --> 12:45.610
It had never even occurred to me.

12:47.120 --> 12:50.940
<i>I've been focusing so hard on 
fixing the empire's finances,</i>

12:50.940 --> 12:54.730
<i>and now the measures implemented 
thanks to Her Highness's support</i>

12:54.730 --> 12:57.080
<i>are all steadily showing results.</i>

12:57.630 --> 13:02.550
<i>But if even one disease outbreak occurred,
 that would all be meaningless.</i>

13:03.520 --> 13:04.300
<i>Could it be?</i>

13:05.290 --> 13:08.760
<i>Had she already perceived that risk</i>

13:09.250 --> 13:11.970
<i>and was trying to help me see it?</i>

13:12.780 --> 13:18.320
<i>Might she be a great leader 
sent by heaven to the capital?</i>

13:19.620 --> 13:23.680
<i>Ludwig shook in an awe 
entirely of his own making.</i>

13:24.630 --> 13:29.620
I appreciate your opening the 
church to this sick child.

13:29.870 --> 13:35.080
No need. We are simply doing our 
duty as servants of the divine.

13:35.870 --> 13:37.040
Princess Mia, Your Highness.

13:37.980 --> 13:41.630
I have organized my thoughts on 
possible epidemic countermeasures.

13:41.630 --> 13:44.880
Excellent. I knew I could count on you.

13:45.250 --> 13:47.450
There are two ways to prevent disease.

13:47.930 --> 13:52.060
One: Distribute food to the residents 
to ensure they are hale.

13:52.480 --> 13:55.600
Two: Provide sufficient medical institutions.

13:56.310 --> 13:58.360
Only, to do so...

13:58.360 --> 14:01.570
You mean to say it would 
require vast sums of money?

14:03.280 --> 14:05.230
It's not just the hospital construction,

14:05.230 --> 14:08.030
but also maintenance costs and 
continuous provision of food.

14:08.380 --> 14:13.110
It would require a ground-up budget revision 
and an even greater tightening of expenditures.

14:16.080 --> 14:17.460
I see.

14:20.440 --> 14:21.190
Then...

14:31.350 --> 14:33.560
would selling this be enough?

14:33.950 --> 14:37.720
Princess Mia, don't you adore that hairpin?

14:37.720 --> 14:39.520
I do not mind.

14:40.040 --> 14:42.240
No matter how precious something is to you,

14:42.240 --> 14:44.560
even if you grasp it tight as you can,

14:44.560 --> 14:46.480
it will be lost when you lose it,

14:46.480 --> 14:48.240
and it will be broken when it breaks.

14:48.990 --> 14:52.820
So you ought to put it to the 
most meaningful use you can.

14:53.520 --> 14:54.830
Princess Mia!

14:55.660 --> 14:56.530
Your Highness...

14:56.530 --> 14:57.790
I can say that you...

14:58.470 --> 15:00.750
<i>are truly a saint!</i>

15:01.740 --> 15:05.210
<i>Yes, meaningful use...</i>

15:06.640 --> 15:09.360
<i>If it's only going to be 
stolen from me in the future,</i>

15:09.360 --> 15:13.930
<i>it's 100 million times better to 
sell it now and use it for myself!</i>

15:16.720 --> 15:20.260
Princess Mia, I have taken your 
feelings firmly to heart.

15:20.260 --> 15:21.760
I, Ludwig, solemnly swear

15:21.760 --> 15:25.610
to make maximum use of this 
treasure bestowed to me.

15:28.480 --> 15:33.600
<i>Princess Mia is well aware that the 
sum raised by selling this hairpin</i>

15:33.600 --> 15:35.470
<i>would be a far cry from the amount needed.</i>

15:36.000 --> 15:39.770
<i>This is the young princess showing 
the highest level of benevolence.</i>

15:41.360 --> 15:43.710
The project needs further funding.

15:44.120 --> 15:47.670
Gracious nobles of the empire, what say you?

15:48.170 --> 15:51.690
<i>The nobles will be taken 
aback by her generous act</i>

15:51.690 --> 15:54.640
<i>and be forced to put money 
of their own forward.</i>

15:54.640 --> 15:56.590
<i>Thus it was that twenty days later,</i>

15:54.640 --> 15:59.100
Designated Hospital Construction Site

15:56.590 --> 16:02.340
<i>it was decided that a large hospital 
would be built in the New Moon District.</i>

16:05.760 --> 16:08.980
I bought the frozen desert that has 
been so popular in the streets.

16:09.260 --> 16:11.600
My, they look just delectable!

16:11.600 --> 16:16.160
When I told them I was buying them 
for you, they gave me a discount.

16:16.430 --> 16:21.310
People throughout the city know you 
were the impetus for the new hospital.

16:21.310 --> 16:22.640
They do?

16:22.640 --> 16:26.130
They're saying you're the people's goddess.

16:26.570 --> 16:28.840
I-I didn't do all that much...

16:29.280 --> 16:34.090
But you did. I'm proud I get to 
serve such a wonderful person.

16:34.090 --> 16:40.660
Th-Then as a special treat, the kind 
princess will share these with you.

16:40.660 --> 16:41.810
Are you certain?

16:42.100 --> 16:42.980
Quite!

16:45.970 --> 16:47.690
Is something amiss?

16:47.690 --> 16:51.990
No. I was just thinking how much I'd like 
to let my younger sister Eris try these.

16:52.580 --> 16:56.450
Eris has a frail constitution and 
is unable go outside much.

16:56.910 --> 17:00.140
I was thinking she must never 
have had a frozen desert...

17:00.140 --> 17:04.410
In that case, how do you feel 
about dropping by your house now?

17:06.070 --> 17:06.750
What?

17:11.280 --> 17:12.650
It's wonderful!

17:13.580 --> 17:17.880
Oh, but I'm not dressed properly to 
be in Your Highness's presence...

17:17.880 --> 17:19.760
Please just take it easy.

17:20.150 --> 17:21.740
B-But...

17:21.740 --> 17:24.470
Eris, don't worry about it.

17:24.470 --> 17:27.230
Princess Mia is an understanding person.

17:27.520 --> 17:30.770
She will gladly excuse such a small affront.

17:30.770 --> 17:33.440
Indeed. I take no offense whatsoever.

17:38.360 --> 17:43.140
<i>Even as it melts the moment it enters my 
mouth, the sweet fragrance fills my nose!</i>

17:43.140 --> 17:45.440
<i>Frozen desserts rule!</i>

17:45.440 --> 17:48.080
<i>Mia was fully focused on the frozen desert.</i>

17:48.320 --> 17:53.100
Isn't this great, Eris? You were saying 
how much you would like to meet Princess Mia.

17:53.100 --> 17:56.050
Oh, you desired to meet me that much?

17:56.550 --> 17:58.510
Yes! Um, you see...

17:59.960 --> 18:02.470
I write stories.

18:02.800 --> 18:06.140
<i>The Impoverished Prince 
and the Golden Dragon...</i>

18:06.140 --> 18:09.190
Wait, I recognize this 
title from somewhere...

18:10.820 --> 18:13.570
<i>The Impoverished Prince and the Golden Dragon.</i>

18:13.570 --> 18:16.690
It's a story about a prince and a dragon.

18:16.690 --> 18:21.420
Thus began a journey to spread 
smiles through the kingdom.

18:21.420 --> 18:23.520
I should love to hear more.

18:23.520 --> 18:26.700
Spending every day in this 
cell is so dull and boring.

18:26.950 --> 18:28.160
Certainly.

18:28.160 --> 18:31.420
But it seems like the story 
is still being written.

18:31.420 --> 18:35.240
Once I get the next portion from 
the author, I'll bring it with me.

18:35.240 --> 18:37.420
I am looking forward to it.

18:38.620 --> 18:40.970
The author can't finish the story?

18:41.520 --> 18:46.420
Forgive me. I won't be able to 
read you the rest of the story.

18:46.420 --> 18:49.510
Whyever not? Is the author in a slump?

18:49.510 --> 18:50.660
No!

18:51.790 --> 18:53.570
She's no longer with us.

18:54.880 --> 18:57.280
She had always been frail...

18:57.570 --> 19:00.870
But with the famine, 
she couldn't get proper food...

19:02.700 --> 19:06.180
<i>So she was talking about Eris.</i>

19:06.700 --> 19:09.910
This story is fantastic.

19:10.410 --> 19:15.710
Eris, serve as my personal author.

19:16.260 --> 19:17.420
Me?

19:18.110 --> 19:19.170
Yes.

19:19.170 --> 19:24.950
That way I can have you focus on creative 
endeavors without worrying about money.

19:24.950 --> 19:27.100
Um, please don't do this!

19:27.420 --> 19:29.990
What? Is there a problem?

19:29.990 --> 19:33.440
I believe this would be a 
good arrangement for you.

19:34.420 --> 19:37.780
Please don't show me favoritism 
because of my sister!

19:38.180 --> 19:41.590
Eris! How could you say 
such a thing to Princess Mia!

19:41.590 --> 19:44.490
I want to earn things on 
the merit of my stories!

19:45.070 --> 19:48.700
I don't want to be hired as an 
author because of you, Anne!

19:49.240 --> 19:54.420
Oh, dear. You should know I proposed 
based on the talent I see in your work.

19:54.940 --> 19:58.170
That's untrue! You couldn't have 
read it in so short a time!

19:59.250 --> 20:03.350
Eris, you would do well to remember this.

20:03.350 --> 20:06.140
I am not fond of falsehoods.

20:07.930 --> 20:12.600
If I had to say what
 I like best about the story...

20:13.090 --> 20:17.830
First, the protagonist is 
depicted very charmingly.

20:17.830 --> 20:22.820
And the dragon's slightly biting personality 
makes their interactions quite amusing.

20:23.240 --> 20:26.530
Wow. In that small span of time...

20:26.800 --> 20:31.250
Finally, the duel scene on the 
bridge with the antagonist, Simon.

20:31.920 --> 20:35.930
Their emotional clash juxtaposed 
with the clash of their blades—

20:35.930 --> 20:37.630
I couldn't get enough of that moment!

20:38.160 --> 20:39.630
Your Highness...

20:40.760 --> 20:41.840
Yes?

20:43.270 --> 20:47.350
How do you know about the 
parts I haven’t written yet?

20:48.840 --> 20:49.450
Huh?

20:50.590 --> 20:53.600
<i>I-I royally messed up!</i>

20:53.600 --> 20:57.380
<i>Of course. The version I know 
is from several years from now.</i>

20:57.380 --> 21:00.690
<i>Obviously it would have more of 
the story than what exists now...</i>

20:58.980 --> 21:00.690
<b>Ah, yes.
I see!</b>

21:00.690 --> 21:05.150
<i>I was just comfortably talking without 
taking that into consideration!</i>

21:05.930 --> 21:08.290
That isn't surprising, Eris.

21:08.960 --> 21:15.150
An individual as sagacious as Princess Mia 
can easily see where a story is going.

21:15.150 --> 21:19.960
<i>Ludwig has a serious case, but Anne 
displays quite severe symptoms as well.</i>

21:19.960 --> 21:22.860
Yes, that! That's basically it!

21:25.120 --> 21:27.200
Th-That's incredible!

21:27.200 --> 21:30.720
<i>Oh, right. Her apple fell 
from the same tree as Anne's.</i>

21:32.640 --> 21:35.140
I shall extend my offer again, Eris.

21:35.860 --> 21:38.500
Become my personal author.

21:39.120 --> 21:43.320
Then make sure you finish writing this story.

21:44.590 --> 21:45.380
I will!

21:46.080 --> 21:49.290
Thank you very much, 
Your Highness Princess Mia!

21:49.290 --> 21:54.750
<i>Thus did the empire gain yet 
another ardent follower of Mia.</i>

21:55.840 --> 22:02.310
<i>She would one day write, </i>The Life 
of the Saint, Imperial Princess Mia<i>,</i>

22:02.310 --> 22:05.640
<i>a work of nearly entirely 
fiction glorifying Mia,</i>

22:05.640 --> 22:08.310
<i>would wind up flying off the shelves.</i>

22:08.310 --> 22:10.830
<i>But that is another story.</i>

23:01.840 --> 23:07.510
<i>Come spring, I will leave the castle and 
start dorm life at Saint Noel Academy.</i>

23:08.050 --> 23:13.200
<i>I have pored over my diary and 
prepared for this in my own way.</i>

23:13.600 --> 23:17.840
<i>In case the disastrous 
revolution still occurs,</i>

23:17.840 --> 23:20.670
<i>my goal is to build the most 
beneficial connections I can</i>

23:21.120 --> 23:25.360
<i>and to stay away from dangerous individuals 
who might lead me to the guillotine.</i>

23:25.360 --> 23:30.170
<i>Especially Tiona Rudolvon 
and Sion Sol Sunkland.</i>

23:30.590 --> 23:33.510
<i>I'll have nothing to do with those two!</i>
